{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvb8Ly2jbBLDEQceTCvZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't start SOC 2 yet, and don't drop it. Spend about a week analysing the evidence first, then decide.**\n\nThree asks and one loss in a month is a real signal, but it's thin. A £60k, six-month commitment shouldn't rest on it, and the data to settle it already exists.\n\n**What to check (a few days of work):**\n- Tag the 140 lost deals for security or compliance mentions. Read the notes, not just the loss-reason field. Reps often log \"no decision\" or \"price\" when security was the real blocker.\n- Pull stalled and open deals, and any deals that needed a security questionnaire. SOC 2 often delays deals more than it kills them.\n- Record the deal size and segment for each one, and whether the prospect would accept an alternative.\n- Ask sales how many enterprise deals you're currently pursuing or want to pursue. SOC 2 matters more if you're moving upmarket.\n\n**Decision rule (set it before looking at the data):**\n- If SOC 2-attributable lost and stalled revenue would, at a realistic 30–50% recovery rate, repay about £60k plus audit upkeep within 12–18 months, start now.\n- If it's a handful of small deals, park it.\n- If it's in between, do a cheaper interim step: a trust page, a pen test, a standard questionnaire pack, or a SOC 2 Type I via a compliance-automation tool.\n\n**Caveats:**\n- Loss data only shows deals you reached. It won't show prospects who never entered the pipeline because of the missing report.\n- Six months matters. If the analysis points to yes, every week of delay pushes the report out by a week.\n- A HR tool holds sensitive employee data, so security reviews will probably get stricter, not looser.\n\nI haven't seen your CRM, so I can't say which way the data will point."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3446,"cache_read_input_tokens":5036,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3446},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6088b38-c6e0-44fe-b808-8e966cd1f059","uuid":"d591000f-865a-4a48-bfda-782f2ed4d023","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:14:36.543Z","request_id":"req_011Cfvb8LgAFkGcBTscvW1L3"}
